SUMMARY:Good Manners/As Boas Maneiras Film Screening
DESCRIPTION:The Black Film Center &amp\; Archive is partnering with La Ca
 sa to bring you Good Manners / As Boas Maneiras (Juliana Rojas &amp\; Mar
 co Dutra\, 2017). Clara\, a lonely nurse from the outskirts of São Paulo
 \, is hired by mysterious and wealthy Ana as the nanny for her unborn chi
 ld. The two women develop a strong bond\, but a fateful night changes the
 ir plans. &#160\;
